		"description": "<p>While you were dead, your brain was altered in a rather dramatic fashion, resulting in higher cognitive abilities.</p><h2>Fast Learner</h2><p>Cut any training or retraining times, as well as resulting costs, to 1/5th.</p><h2>Mental Focus</h2><p>Choose three intelligence or wisdom based skills that you gain expertise in. You may retrain these three skills during a long rest. You do not need to be proficient to gain this expertise.</p><h2>Cortextual Stress</h2><p>You gain disadvantage when making saving throws against mental stress effects. However, you also ignore the penalties of the first level of Strife.</p>",
